{"title": "Fundamental Rights: Arts. 12-13 & doctrines",
 "tag": "Indian Polity",
 "quote": "FRs are qualified, not absolute - and they limit Parliament itself (Art. 13)",
 "boxes": [
  {"type": "bullets", "title": "Basics of Part III",
   "items": [
    "**Arts. 12-35**; from the **US Bill of Rights**; \"**Magna Carta of India**\"",
    "Originally **seven**, now ==**six**== (PYQ 2018)",
    "Property removed by **44th (1978)** → legal right **Art. 300-A**",
    "Justiciable: SC (**Art. 32**), HCs (**Art. 226**)",
    "Citizens only: ==**Arts. 15, 16, 19, 29, 30**=="
   ]},
  {"type": "table", "title": "Six groups",
   "head": ["Group", "Articles"],
   "rows": [
    ["Equality", "**14-18**"],
    ["Freedom", "**19-22**"],
    ["Against exploitation", "**23-24**"],
    ["Religion", "**25-28**"],
    ["Cultural & educational", "**29-30**"],
    ["Constitutional remedies", "**32**"]
   ]},
  {"type": "bullets", "title": "Art. 12 & Art. 13",
   "items": [
    "**Art. 12 State**: Union + state govts and legislatures, ==local + other authorities==",
    "**13(1)** pre-constitution laws void to extent of inconsistency (⚠ APP: \"before Independence\" - wrong)",
    "**13(2)** no law abridging FRs; **13(3)** law incl. ordinance, bye-law, **custom or usage**",
    "**13(4)**: not for Art. 368 amendments (**24th**, **1971**)"
   ]},
  {"type": "timeline", "title": "Art. 12 cases",
   "items": [
    {"when": "1967", "what": "**Rajasthan SEB v. Mohan Lal**: statutory bodies = other authorities"},
    {"when": "1979", "what": "**R.D. Shetty**: instrumentality tests"},
    {"when": "1981", "what": "==**Ajay Hasia**==: deep and pervasive control"},
    {"when": "2002", "what": "**Pradeep Kumar Biswas**: dominated by govt"}
   ]},
  {"type": "table", "title": "Doctrines → case",
   "head": ["Doctrine", "Idea", "Case"],
   "rows": [
    ["==**Severability**==", "Only inconsistent part void", "**A.K. Gopalan** (**1950**); **R.M.D.C.** (**1957**)"],
    ["==**Eclipse**==", "Dormant, revives when conflict removed", "**Bhikaji Narain** (**1955**); Ambica Mills (**1974**)"],
    ["**Waiver**", "FR cannot be waived", "**Basheshar Nath** (**1959**)"],
    ["**Prospective overruling**", "Future only", "**Golaknath** (**1967**)"],
    ["**Absolute liability**", "No exceptions", "**M.C. Mehta** (**1987**) Oleum"],
    ["**Territorial nexus**", "Sufficient connection", "R.M.D.C. (**1957**)"]
   ]},
